5696", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_246912791209029_5540108180063733703_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4CRZQJ9rZ5IQ7kNvwHlBifI&_nc_oc=Adkdl5zBTEYFVP8n11cUXZ4b0qna78skXUTVJycKSZJUyjFyfs7MobsLFTUFigftuVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxNcjYh2NQh3vUlV7WnVInPp7oeqf-6vCnBQS7hnktsYQ&oe=69BA812E"}, {"file_name": "Print 3.png", "id": "2170405556482566", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572950_2170405559815899_5420058398011207589_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qfDcNu2cUBkQ7kNvwHMq8iZ&_nc_oc=AdmOZXOluR_usJPPV6RsjJN_BTej3N1IhQZjR7-oTag4L_mn6XcIYcBECKQsPDoAVWs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzNO5GUW9z7o53DIoYK5Am4i6kr7tZRWMjZ1QCYzLWaOQ&oe=69BA92EF"}, {"file_name": "Print 5.png", "id": "921050275807580", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974548_921050279140913_846272164452751718_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j3z_5SEsalQQ7kNvwHLC6Ib&_nc_oc=AdkYq7yUNCbea0sSqpdlOKJsQ9CeAAGcN0nm_rD6CilL3DbkuM_uAo2j_O__td3_WeE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxRkeGdD5xGCsYCcza9dVUMr2GRTA2LD5DsvQvbTsCP3w&oe=69BA85D7"}, {"file_name": "Print 2.png", "id": "1288706015050300", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_1288706018383633_3836298053771559642_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g_GQjmWh1b4Q7kNvwFPm9wA&_nc_oc=AdmrSiB90l7dPwV2jZlR_psu0CWNU2IidpDy1YEPS1g0tCV4c0j2jBtIAhi7V5S0WQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzkXWEhtgUUy680_kqCPlMLUA5EX4cj90bdu5BL0U0JMA&oe=69BA8F91"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Final v.0.1 (eeve).png", "id": "945385240225978", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974721_945385243559311_50820886768660782_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FUSYP1O5Am4Q7kNvwGIOicB&_nc_oc=Adk4GApYCfPEkRjFUITxxjF0p7lpiaZSggtSlhct1i4AFGRhJceGtMPFeKO3yYnzmr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxGb9Xes9QhaYrDY4PtGnQxi2j1or9-hmiEB4fkdn56NA&oe=69BA953C"}, "display_name": "My Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "My Room is the game experience that allows you to interact with your friends and also create your own world.\n\nCustomize your character and explore our two game modes: Playground & My Room.\n\nIn the Playground you will find yourself in a multiplayer environment surrounded by minigames that are available to play with others. These games include:\n- Soccer: score as many goals as you can\n- Air Hockey (Arcade): play with the AI or with another player\n- Basketball (Arcade): throw the balls and try to score points\n- Cornhole (Arcade): have fun trying to score as you play with the bean bags\n- Darts (Arcade): practice your aiming in the available stations\n- Mini Golf (Arcade): try to aim the hole at the mini golf courses\nThe multiplayer also includes voice/text chat for you to communicate with other players\n\nWhen in My Room, you will be able to customize your own space. You can choose between 3 different themed templates, explore and change it the way you prefer.\n\n* Find more information about the gameplay itself the app*\n\nUpcoming updates in the near future:\n- Game monetary system\n- Shop\n- More games\n- More rooms\n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "Play minigames along with your friends in a multiplayer environment or explore and customize your own room with this experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "VResearch Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres":